<title>JAPAN: Kyoei Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyoei Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.08		vs	   31.41</p>
<p> Operating	  692    million    vs	  450    million</p>
<p> Current	    627    million    vs	  274    million</p>
<p> Net		  267    million    vs	  101    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.83 yen	  vs	    3.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyoei Sangyo Co Ltd is trading company mainly dealing in electronic equipment and materials, chemicals and computers.</p>
